{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_01_beg","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_01","title":"意外入選","storyCode":"DH-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ab3715ba3d4f6b8df0e7f42ddde551cfc080956c798105dd4b2c783a6bf22a79","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陳正欲參加比賽，卻從埃內斯托那裡得知，林雨霞在與人戰鬥，她急忙趕去，卻和林雨霞一同誤入大獎賽的海選現場。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（人感覺和汐斯塔一樣多，不過氛圍上完全不一樣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（到處都是酒吧、賭場、餐廳......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"美女，要不要和我們一起去沙灘邊玩啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"滾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（林雨霞一大早人就不見了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......我準備再給那隻下水道老鼠打個電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我沒怎麼來過這裡，但我覺得特殊部隊一定在做可怕的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過貧民區的林嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過。是個很和善的老人，比我爺爺好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......他可是“鼠王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾個人不都這樣。但他真的是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是沒想到雨霞她會變成現在這個樣子。明明以前是個又膽小又靦腆的孩子，經常躲在你背後來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得她沒有變。她只是......擔負起了責任。也許並不該屬於她的責任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，反正她跑不了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，來都來了，找點事做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（做點什麼呢......買土產？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（星熊和詩懷雅她們......買回去還要寄，有點麻煩，等她們什麼時候過來外勤給她們好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（對了，也要給文月夫人準備一份謝禮。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（羅德島的話......白雪，風笛，阿米婭，還有......她？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了。總之，人有點多，不知道能不能帶得過來，看情況再說吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過感覺也花不了多少時間......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（到處走走？......反正幹什麼都要到處走的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（讓那個埃內斯托帶我參觀一下城市的景點？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......算了，不熟。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（對了，坎黛拉市長說的那件事......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近這段日子裡，城裡的武器流通變得有些異常頻繁，如果你們玩樂之餘覺得有些不夠刺激，那麼，你們不妨試試調查著玩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個人明明是市長，卻一點也不關心自己的城市，魏彥吾怎麼會結交這樣的人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且這座城市，完全是紙醉金迷、驕奢淫逸的代名詞......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......詩懷雅說不定會喜歡這種地方，我寧願回汐斯塔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，算了，來都來了，查案總比沒事幹強，還是查查看吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（雖然坎黛拉市長說查案的事也可以問埃內斯托，不過如果他們有明確的線索的話肯定早就行動了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（直接去問大概是問不出什麼的，還是先到處走走，從瞭解城市開始吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊惱的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚戰況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"贏了幾千，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊惱的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我輸慘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒事，今天贏回來不就完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊惱的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你說我也這麼打算，*玻利瓦爾感歎詞*，還是這裡爽，我根本不想回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"誰不是呢，一回到外面就又要看打打殺殺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，我們沒錢在這買套房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊惱的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"賭贏不就有了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，有道理！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的酒吧招待","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這位美麗的小姐，有興趣來我們酒吧工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的酒吧招待","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像你這麼漂亮的人，一晚上就能賺大錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"滾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"賭場、酒吧、餐廳、卡拉OK，這座城市裡除了這些就沒有別的了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......距離海選結束，還有兩天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳轉過頭去，發現聲音是從路邊商店櫥窗中擺放的電視機中傳來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"20_I00"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位市民們，遊客們，有在好好享受你們的假期嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天在賭場輸了三十萬，今天可是打算去贏回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，在經過為期十天的角逐後，多索雷斯極限大獎賽的海選將在今天結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而午後三點，也就是三個小時之後，我們將迎來海選中最後一場的大亂鬥海選賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是熱愛大獎賽的你絕對不能錯過的一場比賽！千萬不要忘記前往比賽現場享受刺激的氛圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，不想忍受炎炎夏日和擁擠的人群也不用著急，鎖定我們的官方電視台，我們會準點為你直播賽事內容！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，這裡還有一條說不定會讓音樂愛好者們非常興奮的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，可能你們已經聽到了消息，坎黛拉市長居然請來了塞壬唱片旗下的知名音樂人，D.D.D.。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這位蒙面示人的音樂人，不僅將為我們帶來她那奔放的電子樂，還將擔任本次大獎賽的特邀主持！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"妮娜，快點，你沒聽到嗎，還有一個小時比賽就開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的女遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"打架有什麼好看的，太野蠻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"混戰海選出線的人都是比賽的黑馬，不注意一下可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的女遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"那你去看吧，看完記得告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"你這女人......嘖，算了，自己去就自己去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，真的假的，我前幾天就聽說D.D.D.來了，沒想到是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的女遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得她上個月好像還在汐斯塔，居然現在就到多索雷斯來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的女遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"而且居然能請動她來當主持，坎黛拉市長究竟是怎麼說服她的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的女遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道？現在不少人都在猜，D.D.D.很有可能是一名女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛音樂的男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......我是覺得是男是女都無所謂，反正我們有耳福了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳意識到，幾乎所有人都在談論著比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（這場比賽，看來確實受到這座城市裡大部分人的關注。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......要想在比賽之中搞事情，對方肯定不會放過作為參賽選手混入其中，伺機製造混亂的機會。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然如此......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，是陳小姐嗎？哈哈，抱歉，我這邊現在稍微有些不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手機那邊傳來的聲音","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和人戰鬥？發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這就有些說來話長了，簡單來說，林小姐和人打起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在在哪裡？我來找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好，我在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"三小時前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要幫他？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"幼稚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"林小姐，需要我幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過，你對這座城市很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"背景獨立的小賭場，有沒有辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"背景獨立......您是想要惹事了不會有什麼大問題的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這樣的話您不用擔心，有坎黛拉女士在，誰都不敢找您的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想要的是，收拾起來不麻煩的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，這是一家酒吧賭場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆阿拉斯白手起家，靠著一股狠勁硬生生在這條街上把這家店開到這麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周圍幾條街的勢力都很想要他這家店，不過誰都啃不下他這塊硬骨頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡等著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場嘍囉","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"請問您是要喝酒還是玩兩把？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩兩把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場嘍囉","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好厲害的女人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場嘍囉","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快去把老闆叫過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我不管你是誰，但你太狂妄了，一個人來這樣的地方鬧事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說廢話。開牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"四條。呵呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同花順。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你藏牌的手法太差了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我承認你可能確實有些本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你們的武器都掏出來吧，我趕時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，小的們，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然事先有做過調查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這就是龍門鼠王之女的做法嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，您來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幫人打不過林小姐就跑了，林小姐追去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"往哪個方向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊，沙灘方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑得還挺快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞，你在搞什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔？你來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是我在問你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，哪來的神經病，打不過，還甩不掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場嘍囉","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"還能怎麼辦，跑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊是......混戰海選會場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，正好。我們混進去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒空管你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"這都要追上來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不過這裡可是有許多我天然的幫手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"小的們，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......剛才電視裡說過的亂鬥比賽會場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，沒辦法，先把周圍的人都解決掉吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
